# A PERC track starts as a KIT; SEQ opens on its DRUM page; the top-row buttons still open their sections.
wait 300
tap HOME
turn SELECT -20
turn K3 3
wait 200
expect tp 1 KIND 3
expect tp 1 MODE 1
tap SEQ
wait 200
expect page DRUM
tap FX
wait 200
expect page DELAY
tap SEQ
wait 200
expect page DRUM
